analyses.abstract:
In this paper we study an equivalence between the existence of a Sobolev inequality without gain, \[\|\varphi\|_{L^p(v,Ω)} \leq S(p,1) \| \sqrt{Q}
abla \varphi\|_{L^p(Ω)},\] that holds for smooth functions of compact support and the existence of a degenerate weak solution $(u,
abla u)\in QH^{1,p}_0(v,Ω)$ to a Dirichlet problem for the $p$-Laplacian with a zero order term:  egin{equation*} -v^{-1}	ext{Div}(|\sqrt{Q}
abla u|^{p-2}Q
abla u)+F|u|^{p-2}u = |f|^{p-2}f - v^{-1}	ext{Div}(v|g|^{p-2}g\mathbf{t}),\; x \in Ω, \quad 	ext{and} \quad u =0, \; x \in \partial Ω, \end{equation*} More precisely, we use the Sobolev inequality to prove the existence of a degenerate weak solution to this equation and then use the existence of such a solution to produce a Sobolev inequality. Moreover, we show that solutions are unique.

analyses.workSummary:
针对带有低阶项的退化 $p$-Laplace 方程 $-v^{-1}\operatorname{Div}(|\sqrt{Q}
abla u|^{p-2}Q
abla u) + F|u|^{p-2}u = |f|^{p-2}f - v^{-1}\operatorname{Div}(v|g|^{p-2}g\mathbf{t})$，作者证明了无增益退化 Sobolev 不等式 $\|\varphi\|_{L^p(v,\Omega)} \le S(p,1)\|\sqrt{Q}
abla \varphi\|_{L^p(\Omega)}$ 的成立与该 Dirichlet 边值问题退化弱解 $(u,
abla u) \in QH^{1,p}_0(v,\Omega)$ 的存在性、Caccioppoli 型能量正则性估计以及唯一性之间的充要等价关系。该结果完全解耦了权重 $v$ 与半正定矩阵 $Q$ 的经典强关联假设，不依赖 Muckenhoupt $A_p$ 条件或倍测度性质，仅需基本的局部可积性条件即可成立。
